[node name="BladeStall" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-400, 186)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("15_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Blades"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A guild factor's table[/b]

Good swords, cheap. Too cheap. Each blade carries a little hammer-over-pine stamped near the tang: the smith's mark from Thornhaven, three days west.

The tag on the bundle reads \"[i]Valley steel, Guild-licensed. Received Riverside.[/i]\" A Thornhaven smith sells to Thornhaven folk. Someone else sold these."
reexamine_text = "Thornhaven steel, three days from home, sold by the Guild."

