[node name="LanternPlinthInscription" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(0, 186)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("15_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Plinth"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The Lantern of the Grey Year[/b]

A lamp that never goes out, on a plinth worn smooth by hands. The inscription: \"[i]For the eleven thousand of Highmarch taken by the Grey Fever. Lit by the Cathedral of the Dawn, that we remember mercy.[/i]\"

Underneath, in smaller letters added later: \"[i]Restored at the charge of the noble House of Ashdown.[/i]\"

Fresh wax on the steps. Someone has been lighting candles here again this month."
reexamine_text = "Fresh candles for the Grey Fever, twenty years on."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/LanternPlinthInscription"]
