[node name="WeighSlate" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-640, 150)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("15_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Weigh-Slate"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The Guild weigh-house slate[/b]

Today's receipts, chalked by a clerk with a neat hand:
\"[i]Warehouse Seven, Riverside. Valley wool, by Ferrisford barge. 40 bales.[/i]\"

The weight column says forty bales of wool weigh as much as a forge's anvil stock. Nobody has corrected it. The origin column, which every other line fills in, is blank."
reexamine_text = "Forty bales of 'wool' that weigh like iron."

